# PURPOSE
# Keep large, generated, private, or machine-specific artefacts out of version control.
# Research repositories become difficult to reproduce when raw data, model weights,
# and generated figures are accidentally mixed with the source code that produced them.

# Python caches and local environments
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# Notebook and editor state
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Secrets and machine-local settings
.env
*.local.yaml

# Data, weights, and generated outputs. Each directory contains a README that explains
# how to populate it; the contents themselves should normally stay local.
data/**
!data/README.md
!data/GENIMAGE.md
!data/manifest_template.csv
checkpoints/**
!checkpoints/README.md
outputs/**
!outputs/README.md

# IMPLEMENTATION CHECKLIST
# [ ] Review this list before the first commit.
# [ ] Confirm that no raw dataset licences prohibit committing metadata.
# [ ] Add project-specific IDE or cluster artefacts as they appear.
